  <description>Model of the NXP HoverGames Drone development kit (KIT-HGDRONEK66). The PX4 software compatible kit provides mechanical, RC remote and other components needed to evaluate the RDDRONE-FMUK66 reference design. PX4 x500 variant that uses the flight_x500_base model with read-only contact sensors.</description>
